<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5544/5556.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5544/5556.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5544/5556 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Monday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Tuesday will be 5550.</p>
<p>On Friday the bid/offer rates were 5545/5555, with the official dollar rate 5550 from Saturday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5478/6078 after 5475/6075.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
